## Note

born: 2026-10-17
source: director, >run.05.01
The callers are compute, model, and user.
The user is the director. Authority stays with a person who can assume the risk.
caller: sits on the ask. The header who stays the writer.
The pages live with compute. The model requests a compact form.
reply: is the user only. The model records its work on status:.
Compute does as much as the rule and the files allow. It may write status closed while reply is blank.
One ask names one caller. A missing caller halts.
Sign, approve, promote, grant, and merge to main stay with the user for now.
Law 0056 was not edited.
